  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n¬P∨(Q∧¬R)≡(¬P∨Q)∧(¬P∨¬R)\n$$\n\nNow, since $¬P∨Q≡Q∨¬P,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(¬P∨Q)∧(¬P∨¬R)≡(Q∨¬P)∧(¬P∨¬R).\n$$",
